  farmer in every twenty was thrown off his land for failure to make mortga
 ge repayments</span></li>\n<li><span>23\,000 people committed suicide\, th
 e largest yearly figure in American history</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong
 >Directions:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Please make a <a href="https://docs.g
