 span></h2>\n<p><span style="font-family: georgia\, palatino\;">In digital 
 spaces\, language is not shaped only by human speakers. It is also shaped 
 by <strong>platform rules\, recommendation systems\, moderation systems\, 
 and algorithmic visibility.</strong> One recent term for this phenomenon i
 s <strong>algospeak</strong>: language that is deliberately modified to av
 oid automated detection or to adapt to platform conditions.</span></p>\n<t
