 re linked in the assignment if you need to go back and view them again lat
 er.&nbsp\;</li>\n<li>Resources you'll need will be your textbook and any i
 nternet sources you choose.</li>\n<li>Upload your assignment to Canvas whe
 n complete.&nbsp\;</li>\n</ul>
