 /span></p>\n<ol style="list-style-type: decimal\;">\n<li><span style="font
 -family: georgia\, palatino\;">A title\, that clearly indicates the chosen
  IA prompt</span></li>\n<li><span style="font-family: georgia\, palatino\;
 ">An image of your object</span></li>\n<li><span style="font-family: georg
 ia\, palatino\;">Your 320-word commentary</span></li>\n<li><span style="fo
 nt-family: georgia\, palatino\;">Relevant citations and references</span><
