 an></strong></span></h3>\n<table style="border-collapse: collapse\; width:
  100%\; background-color: #c2e0f4\;" border="1">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style
 ="width: 99.8336%\; border-color: #c2e0f4\;">\n<p><span style="font-family
 : georgia\, palatino\;">The total word count for the IB TOK exhibition is 
 a maximum of 950 words for the entire written commentary\, covering all th
 ree objects. This strict limit includes the justifications and analysis bu
 t excludes acknowledgments\, references\, and text with the object.&nbsp\;
 </span></p>\n<p><span style="font-family: georgia\, palatino\;"><strong>St
 ructure:&nbsp\;</strong>Typically divided among three objects (around 300-
 315 words each)</span></p>\n<p><span style="font-family: georgia\, palatin
 o\;"><strong>What is NOT counted:&nbsp\;</strong>Titles\, image captions\,
  references\, bibliographies\, and text inside the object.&nbsp\;</span></
 p>\n<p><span style="font-family: georgia\, palatino\;"><strong>Penalty:&nb
 sp\;</strong>Examiners stop reading after 950 words\, so exceeding the lim
 it risks penalties.</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p class
 ="" style="padding-left: 40px\;" data-start="1257" data-end="1278"><span s
 tyle="font-family: georgia\, palatino\;">Your commentary must:</span></p>\
 n<p class="" style="padding-left: 80px\;" data-start="1281" data-end="1317
 "><span style="font-family: georgia\, palatino\;">✔️ Address the <stro
 ng data-start="1296" data-end="1317">prompt explicitly</strong></span></p>
 \n<p class="" style="padding-left: 80px\;" data-start="1320" data-end="137
 3"><span style="font-family: georgia\, palatino\;">✔️ Focus on <strong
  data-start="1332" data-end="1373">how the object connects to the prompt</
 strong></span></p>\n<p class="" style="padding-left: 80px\;" data-start="1
 376" data-end="1439"><span style="font-family: georgia\, palatino\;">
 ✔️ Show <strong data-start="1384" data-end="1400">TOK thinking</strong
 > (not just opinion or personal stories)</span></p>\n<p class="" style="pa
 dding-left: 80px\;" data-start="1442" data-end="1500"><span style="font-fa
 mily: georgia\, palatino\;">✔️ Be <strong data-start="1448" data-end="
 1466">well supported</strong> with clear examples or references</span></p>
 \n<hr class="" data-start="1502" data-end="1505">\n<h3 class="" data-start
 ="1507" data-end="1541"><span style="color: #0e68b3\;"><strong><span style
 ="font-family: georgia\, palatino\;">To Improve Your Commentary…</span><
 /strong></span></h3>\n<h4 class="" style="padding-left: 40px\;" data-start
 ="1543" data-end="1584"><span style="font-family: georgia\, palatino\;">1.
  <strong data-start="1551" data-end="1584">Keep the Object at the Center</
 strong></span></h4>\n<p class="" data-start="1585" data-end="1765"><span s
 tyle="font-family: georgia\, palatino\;">🟩 Tip: Keep returning to the o
 bject. Don’t drift into a general essay.</span><br data-start="1656" dat
 a-end="1659"><span style="font-family: georgia\, palatino\;"><strong data-
 start="1659" data-end="1667">Ask:</strong> “What does the object show or
  hide?” “How does it influence how knowledge is shared or accepted?”
 </span></p>\n<h4 class="" style="padding-left: 40px\;" data-start="1767" d
 ata-end="1807"><span style="font-family: georgia\, palatino\;">2. <strong 
 data-start="1775" data-end="1807">Move Beyond Personal Opinion</strong></s
 pan></h4>\n<p class="" data-start="1808" data-end="1901"><span style="font
 -family: georgia\, palatino\;">🟩 Tip: Personal experiences are okay\, b
 ut they must <strong data-start="1861" data-end="1883">support a TOK idea<
 /strong>—not be the focus.</span></p>\n<h4 class="" style="padding-left:
  40px\;" data-start="1903" data-end="1941"><span style="font-family: georg
 ia\, palatino\;">3. <strong data-start="1911" data-end="1941">Use TOK Conc
 epts Naturally</strong></span></h4>\n<p class="" data-start="1942" data-en
 d="1995"><span style="font-family: georgia\, palatino\;">🟩 Tip: Don’t
  name-drop “TOK\,” but think in TOK ways:</span></p>\n<p class="" styl
 e="padding-left: 80px\;" data-start="1998" data-end="2030"><span style="fo
 nt-family: georgia\, palatino\;">What counts as useful knowledge?</span></
 p>\n<p class="" style="padding-left: 80px\;" data-start="2033" data-end="2
 070"><span style="font-family: georgia\, palatino\;">Is this personal or s
 hared knowledge?</span></p>\n<p class="" style="padding-left: 80px\;" data
 -start="2073" data-end="2120"><span style="font-family: georgia\, palatino
 \;">What role do values\, evidence\, or culture play?</span></p>\n<h4 clas
 s="" style="padding-left: 40px\;" data-start="2122" data-end="2159"><span 
 style="font-family: georgia\, palatino\;">4. <strong data-start="2130" dat
 a-end="2159">Include Specific Evidence</strong></span></h4>\n<p class="" d
 ata-start="2160" data-end="2206"><span style="font-family: georgia\, palat
 ino\;">🟩 Tip: Add <strong>evidence for support</strong>:</span></p>\n<p
  class="" style="padding-left: 40px\;" data-start="2209" data-end="2220"><
 span style="font-family: georgia\, palatino\;">A statistic</span></p>\n<p 
 class="" style="padding-left: 40px\;" data-start="2223" data-end="2230"><s
 pan style="font-family: georgia\, palatino\;">A quote</span></p>\n<p class
 ="" style="padding-left: 40px\;" data-start="2233" data-end="2268"><span s
 tyle="font-family: georgia\, palatino\;">A specific feature of your object
 </span></p>\n<p class="" style="padding-left: 40px\;" data-start="2271" da
 ta-end="2311"><span style="font-family: georgia\, palatino\;">A reference 
 to a known event or response</span></p>\n<hr>\n<h3 class="" data-start="23
 18" data-end="2351"><span style="color: #0e68b3\;"><strong><span style="fo
 nt-family: georgia\, palatino\;">Useful Reflection Starters</span></strong
 ></span></h3>\n<p class="" style="padding-left: 40px\;" data-start="2353" 
 data-end="2388"><span style="font-family: georgia\, palatino\;">Use these 
 to develop your analysis:</span></p>\n<p class="" style="padding-left: 80p
 x\;" data-start="2391" data-end="2447"><span style="font-family: georgia\,
  palatino\;">“This object reflects knowledge that is valued because…
 ”</span></p>\n<p class="" style="padding-left: 80px\;" data-start="2450"
  data-end="2512"><span style="font-family: georgia\, palatino\;">“In a d
 ifferent context\, this object might be interpreted as…”</span></p>\n<
 p class="" style="padding-left: 80px\;" data-start="2515" data-end="2564">
 <span style="font-family: georgia\, palatino\;">“The way this knowledge 
 is organized influences…”</span></p>\n<p class="" style="padding-left:
  80px\;" data-start="2567" data-end="2626"><span style="font-family: georg
 ia\, palatino\;">“This object challenges the idea that knowledge is alwa
 ys…”</span></p>\n<hr>\n<h3 class="" data-start="2633" data-end="2666">
 <span style="color: #0e68b3\;"><strong><span style="font-family: georgia\,
  palatino\;">&nbsp\;Final Self-Check Questions</span></strong></span></h3>
 \n<p class="" style="padding-left: 40px\;" data-start="2668" data-end="296
 4"><span style="font-family: georgia\, palatino\;">✅ Is my object specif
 ic and real?</span><br data-start="2701" data-end="2704"><span style="font
 -family: georgia\, palatino\;">✅ Did I describe the object clearly?</spa
 n><br data-start="2740" data-end="2743"><span style="font-family: georgia\
 , palatino\;">✅ Do I explain <strong data-start="2758" data-end="2765">h
 ow</strong> the object connects to the prompt?</span><br data-start="2800"
  data-end="2803"><span style="font-family: georgia\, palatino\;">✅ Do I 
 show <strong data-start="2815" data-end="2831">TOK thinking</strong> (not 
 just opinion)?</span><br data-start="2851" data-end="2854"><span style="fo
 nt-family: georgia\, palatino\;">✅ Did I include any <strong data-start=
 "2874" data-end="2897">supporting evidence</strong>?</span><br data-start=
 "2898" data-end="2901"><span style="font-family: georgia\, palatino\;">✅
  Did I avoid just retelling a story or summarizing the object?</span></p>\
 n<div id="preview_1" class="preview_container" style="display: block\;" ro
 le="region">\n<div style="overflow: auto\; border: 1px solid transparent\;
  height: 100%\;"><a class="instructure_file_link instructure_scribd_file a
 uto_open" title="ch6_p438_cle_handout_teacher-1.pdf" href="https://ucps.in
 structure.com/courses/355382/files/45169657?verifier=RPBYheiqxU2a4tnOWdYF8
 9JMxmkVjVZm35R4sR27&amp\;wrap=1" target="_blank" data-canvas-previewable="
 false" data-api-endpoint="https://ucps.instructure.com/api/v1/courses/3553
