DESCRIPTION:Reference[ One World In Data Graph Annual freshwater withdrawal
 s\, 2020] (https://ourworldindata.org/grapher/annual-freshwater-withdrawal
 s) (https://ourworldindata.org/grapher/annual-freshwater-withdrawals)\n\n*
 \n\n* Identify an emerging economy (e.g.\, India\, China\, Brazil) with si
 gnificant water withdrawals.\n\n* Investigate how industrialization is con
 tributing to water stress in this country.\n\n* Use the graph to connect t
 he country's water withdrawals to its industrial growth and economic devel
 opment.\n\n* Identify the specific challenges related to water use (e.g.\,
  industrial pollution\, over-extraction for agriculture).\n\n* Identify go
 vernment policies or solutions that are being implemented to manage water 
 stress.\n\n* What role does population pressure play in exacerbating water
  stress in this low-income country?\n\n* Discuss how limited infrastructur
 e and economic resources contribute to water scarcity despite lower overal
 l water withdrawals.
