 ta.org/grapher/annual-freshwater-withdrawals</a></span>)</p>\n<ol>\n<li st
 yle="list-style-type: none\;">\n<ol>\n<li>Identify an emerging economy (e.
 g.\, India\, China\, Brazil) with significant water withdrawals.</li>\n<li
 >Investigate how industrialization is contributing to water stress in this
  country.</li>\n<li>Use the graph to connect the country's water withdrawa
 ls to its industrial growth and economic development.</li>\n<li>Identify t
 he specific challenges related to water use (e.g.\, industrial pollution\,
  over-extraction for agriculture).</li>\n<li>Identify government policies 
 or solutions that are being implemented to manage water stress.</li>\n<li>
 What role does population pressure play in exacerbating water stress in th
 is low-income country?</li>\n<li>Discuss how limited infrastructure and ec
 onomic resources contribute to water scarcity despite lower overall water 
 withdrawals.</li>\n</ol>\n</li>\n</ol>
