 width="138">\n<p>Clear flow of ideas</p>\n<p>&nbsp\;</p>\n<p>Demonstrates 
 interest in topic and engagement with the class</p>\n</td>\n<td width="138
 ">\n<p>Most ideas flow but focus is lost at times</p>\n<p>&nbsp\;</p>\n<p>
 Limited evidence of interest in and engagement with the topic</p>\n</td>\n
 <td width="138">\n<p>Hard to follow the flow of the ideas</p>\n<p>&nbsp\;<
 /p>\n<p>Lack of enthusiasm and interest.</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td widt
 h="145">\n<p>Visuals</p>\n</td>\n<td width="138">\n<p>Visuals augmented an
 d extend comprehension of the issues in unique ways</p>\n</td>\n<td width=
 "138">\n<p>Use of visuals related to the material</p>\n</td>\n<td width="1
 38">\n<p>Limited use of visuals loosely related to the material</p>\n</td>
 \n<td width="138">\n<p>No use of visuals</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</ta
 ble>
END:VEVENT
