X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<h3 style="text-align: center\;"><span style="
 font-family: georgia\, palatino\; color: #e03e2d\;"><strong>Foundation &am
 p\; Framing</strong></span></h3>\n<p><span style="font-family: georgia\, p
 alatino\;"><strong>Objective:&nbsp\;</strong>Students will understand the 
 purpose and expectations of the EE Cafe and begin refining their RQs by al
